"nu" is valsi, and "prenu" is valsi, and "kei" is valsi.
But is the sequence "nu prenu kei" valsi? Lojbab and usage would
say No. In other words, valsi = valsi pa mei, and "nu prenu kei"
is valsi ci mei.

